# Walkthrough — Module 3: Local Streaming Automatic Speech Recognition (ASR)

Module 3 has been fully implemented! We have built a high-speed, local streaming ASR backend powered by **`faster-whisper` (`tiny` int8 on CPU)**, featuring a rolling-window context buffer, LocalAgreement word-prefix stabilization, partial and final transcript generation with timestamps, duplicate line prevention, automated Word Error Rate (WER) benchmarking, and full end-to-end pipeline integration (`pipeline_server.py`).

