## ⚙️ Architecture & Data Flow

```text
Chrome Extension (Module 1)
      ↓ Stereo Int16 PCM @ 48000 Hz
WebSocket Server (ws://localhost:8765)
      ↓
AudioPreprocessor (Stereo → Mono, Resample 48k → 16k Float32)
      ↓ 16kHz Mono Float32
SileroVadEngine (ONNX CPU Speech Detection)
      ↓ Speech Segments & Frames
StreamingASRManager (3.0s Rolling Window Context)
      ↓
FasterWhisperEngine (tiny int8 CPU Inference)
      ↓ Candidate Words
LocalAgreement Stabilization (Prefix Matching & Duplicate Prevention)
      ↓
 ┌────┴────┐
 ▼         ▼
PARTIAL   FINAL Transcripts
```

