| **Real-Time Factor (RTF)** | **~0.060 (RTF)** | ~0.195 (RTF) |
| **Peak RAM Usage** | **~140 MB** | ~290 MB |
| **CPU Usage** | **< 15%** | ~35% |
| **Word Error Rate (WER)** | **Low (< 10%)** | Slightly lower (< 8%) |

